      "id": 8522,
      "name": "Spiff",
      "username": "Spiff",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/spiff/{size}/1865_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-08-13T14:28:52.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p><span>I thought G.I. Bunker was the guy on \"Ghostly Images\" from the Realm of Discord, but that's not him on there. &nbsp;That Bunker and the be-goggled Legacy fighting next to him look like they're probably one revision earlier than WWII, I'd guess, so WWI-era.</span></p><p>For both the WWII and WWI versions of Bunker, one thing stands out to me in the design of their suits - it must be irritating to not be able to move your head because it's attached by a hose to your chest...</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:39:04.635Z",
      "reply_count": 0,
      "reply_to_post_number": null,
      "quote_count": 0,
