      "id": 70835,
      "name": "Ronway",
      "username": "Ronway",
      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
      "created_at": "2013-08-13T16:34:00.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Even without the tube, I think&nbsp;GI Bunker&nbsp;would have&nbsp;a hard time looking around. As the glass on his chest is where I think his head is and is where he sees out of. As for the Bunker suit on Ghostly Images,&nbsp;he may be in&nbsp;a position to where he sees through the head or the tube on that one works something like a periscope, allowing him to see through the eyes of the suit.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>Edit: Infact you can see the GI Bunker suit, it's the one on the right.</p>",
